  levelInfos:
  - title: Starting Weapon Chest
    description: A Weapon Chest waits next to the ship when the run starts. Open
      it to pick a new weapon before the fight begins.
  - title: Recover 1 Accessory
    description: Once per break, interact with the ship to restore 1 Accessory Guard
      block. The ship glows when it's ready again.
  - title: Starter Perk
    description: Every weapon offered by the starting Weapon Chest comes with at
      least 1 perk.
  levelZeroText: Nothing to see here...
